  "html": "<article id=\"source-0\">\n<h1 id=\"source-1\">Synthetic Reading Document</h1>\n<div>Fixture Author · Original generated material, no real research claims</div>\n<div id=\"source-2\"><h2>Abstract</h2>\n<p id=\"source-3\">This original synthetic article tests a reading document. It retains paragraphs, figures, table cells, and equations.</p>\n<p id=\"source-4\">The numbers below are invented test values. No translation or AI service is used.</p></div>\n<section id=\"source-5\"><h2 id=\"source-6\">1 Introduction</h2>\n<p id=\"source-7\">Read in source order. The encoder maps input to output in <a href=\"#source-9\">Figure 1</a>. See <a href=\"#source-11\">Table 1</a> and <a href=\"#source-17\">[1]</a>.</p>\n<p>Exact values: 91.25%, 0.001, ID-A_7; frozen backbone; few-shot.</p>\n<ul id=\"source-8\"><li>Preserve the first item.</li><li>Preserve the second item with <em>emphasis</em>.</li></ul>\n<figure id=\"source-9\"><img alt=\"Input to encoder to output\" src=\"assets/a7add607917ed603c99255056fcc9b5936a90093c2d4c9c9d3f22003005703dc.png\"/>\n<figcaption id=\"source-10\"><span>Figure 1.</span> Original generated input–encoder–output diagram.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"source-11\"><figcaption><span>Table 1.</span> Invented evaluation scores.</figcaption>\n<table><thead><tr><th rowspan=\"2\">Method</th><th colspan=\"2\">Synthetic benchmark</th></tr><tr><th>Accuracy</th><th>Count</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody><tr><td>Baseline</td><td>89.50</td><td>200</td></tr><tr><td>Proposed</td><td>91.25</td><td>200</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<div id=\"source-12\"><math display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow>\n<annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = W x + b</annotation></semantics></math><span>(1)</span></div>\n<aside id=\"source-13\">Footnote: test content only.</aside>\n</section>\n<section id=\"source-14\"><h2>Appendix A: Reproducibility</h2><p id=\"source-15\">All words and images were generated for this repository.</p></section>\n<section id=\"source-16\"><h2>References</h2><ul><li id=\"source-17\">[1] Fixture Author. Synthetic reference. 2026. Unrelated ID 2410.09453v3 is not the document identity.</li></ul></section>\n</article>",
